    "exerciseText": "High velocity touch typing is the art of effortless forward momentum. When you eliminate hesitation between words, each sentence flows across the screen with the clean precision of a well oiled mechanical watch. Speed develops organically when your foundation is built upon uncompromising accuracy. By cultivating relaxed wrists and light fingertips, you conserve physical energy and unlock a state of continuous cognitive flow. The secret to sustaining seventy words per minute across long passages lies in emotional calmness. Rushing creates muscular tension, whereas steady breathing and disciplined posture maintain unbroken rhythm from start to finish. Athletic keyboard performance requires mindful attention to ergonomics. Keep your elbows relaxed at right angles, allow your forearms to float parallel to the keyboard surface, and strike each switch with crisp, decisive clarity. Speed benchmark verification segment 17: maintain loose wrists and 70+ WPM cadence.",
